      "writtenOn": "2019-02-14T08:10:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why is this necessary now when it wasn\u0027t before? If it is now necessary to call vpnNetworkAgent.setUids() after calling mMockVpn.setUids(), then why don\u0027t we need that after the other calls to mMockVpn.setUids(), of which there are several in this test?",
