        "id": 1399364
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-02-15T00:35:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Coz MockVpn calls updateCapabilities which previously used to send capabilities to CS via NetworkAgent. This CL removed that indirection, hence this call needs to be there.\n\nThe only other place where we call mMockVpn.setUids() without calling vpnNetworkAgent.setUids() is in line 4660. There similar effect is achieved via vpnNetworkAgent.connect() which calls NetworkAgent#sendNetworkCapabilities.",
